<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Acceso denegado - Resultados en Línea</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { font-family: 'Figtree', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; }
        body {
            min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 1.5rem;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 15% 0%, rgba(15,163,177,.2), transparent 60%),
                linear-gradient(160deg, #041D2B 0%, #0A3B52 100%);
        }
        .error-card { width: 100%; max-width: 460px; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.45); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09); overflow: hidden; animation: fadeUp .5s ease both; }
        .error-icon { width: 84px; height: 84px; margin: 0 auto 1rem; border-radius: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 2.4rem; color: #fff; background: #062A3C; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(15,163,177,.45); }
        .error-icon i { color: #0FA3B1; }
        .error-code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0B4F6C; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
        h1, .h4 { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; }
        .ecg-wrap { height: 34px; margin-bottom: .75rem; opacity: .9; }
        .ecg-line { stroke-dasharray: 1400; stroke-dashoffset: 1400; animation: ecg-draw 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
        @keyframes ecg-draw { 0% { stroke-dashoffset: 1400; opacity: 0; } 12% { opacity: 1; } 62% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; } 82% { opacity: 1; } 100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 0; } }
        .error-footer { border-top: 1px solid #E1EAEE; background: #F7FAFB; }
        .btn-primary { background: #0B4F6C; border-color: #0B4F6C; }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: #0E6B8C; border-color: #0E6B8C; }
        @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-card card">
        <div class="card-body p-5 text-center">
            <div class="ecg-wrap">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 600 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="width:100%;height:100%;" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path class="ecg-line" d="M0,50 H90 L105,50 L115,18 L132,82 L146,40 L158,50 H250 L265,50 L275,12 L295,88 L310,50 H400 L415,50 L425,22 L440,72 L455,50 H600"
                          fill="none" stroke="#0FA3B1" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="error-icon"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i></div>
            <div class="error-code">403</div>
            <h1 class="h5 mt-2 mb-3 fw-bold">Acceso denegado</h1>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-4">No tienes permisos para acceder a esta sección. Si crees que esto es un error, contacta al administrador.</p>
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary px-4 py-2"><i class="bi bi-house-door me-1"></i>Volver al inicio</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer error-footer px-4 py-3 text-center">
            <small class="text-muted">Laboratorio Clínico SantaLucia — Resultados en Línea</small>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
